        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Beleshasâ wakalambishila miloho yandi tshinunu bidia bia disanka bia bungi, wakanua nvinyo ku mpala kua bantu aba tshinunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi Beleshasâ ulabula nvinyo, wakatuma mukenji ne, Balue ne mpanza ya or ne ya argent, yakadi tatu wandi Nebukadenesâ muhaule mu ntempelo wa mu Yelushalema bua mukelenge ne miloho yandi, bakashi bandi ne bakashi hahika bakabakeye banuinemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakalua ne mpanza ya or ne ya argent, biakahaulabo mu ntempelo wa mu Yelushalema; yeye mukelenge ne miloho yandi, bakashi bandi ne bakashi bahika bakabakeye bakanuinamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanua nvinyo, bakatumbisha nzambi ya or ne ya argent, ya tshiamu tshia mitaku, ya tshiamu tshifike, ya mitshi ne ya mabue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu diba adi mene minu ya tshianza tshia muntu yakamueneka, yakafunda ha tshimanu tshia mbalasa wa mukelenge, tshiakadi tshilaba luhemba, tshitangilangane ne tshitekelu tshia minda; mukelenge wakatangila tshituha tshia tshianza tshiakadi tshifundahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha bualu ebu mpala wa mukelenge wakandamuka, ne mutshima wandi wakahampakana ne buowa. Manungu a bidimba biandi akahauka, binu biandi biakatutakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakela dî dikole ne, Balue ne bamanyi ba malu a mitoto, Bena Kasada, ne batempi ba mbuku. Mukelenge wakambila bena meji ba mu Babulona ne, Muntu yonso wabala tshifundu etshi, wandesha dijingulula diatshi nebamuluatshishe bilulu bikunzubile, nebamuele lukanu lua or mu nshingu muandi, nebamuteke bu muisatu munkatshi mua bakokeshi na bukelenge ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bena meji bonso ba mukelenge bakabuela muakadiye, kadi kabakamanya mua kubala tshifundu atshi, ne kabakamanya mua kulesha mukelenge dijingulula diatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda au mukelenge Beleshasâ wakakuatshika buowa bikole, mpala wandi wakandamuka, ne mitshima ya milono yandi yakalubakana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua mei a mukelenge ne a miloho yandi, mukelenge mukashi, mamu muledi wa mukelenge, wakabuela mu nsubu wa bidia bia disanka. Mukelenge eu mukashi wakambila mukelenge ne, Mukelenge wikale ne muoyo tshiendelele; mutshima webe kauhampakanyi, mpala webe kandamuki nunku nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu mukuabo udiku mu bukelenge buebe udi ne nyuma wa nzambi ya tshijila munda muandi. Mu matuku a tatuʼebe bakamusangana muikale ne munya, dijingulula dia malu, ne meji, bu meji a nzambi yetu mene. Mukelenge Nebukadenesâ, tatuʼebe mene, wakamuteka kahita ka batempi ba mbuku, bamanyi ba malu a mitoto, Bena Kasada ne bena meji bakuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bakasangana mu Danyele eu, wakuinyikabo ne, Beleteshasâ, kudi mukelenge, lungenyi luhite bukole, meji, dijingulula dia malu, lungenyi lua kujinguluila bantu bilota, lua kutandula majimbu ne lua kuitaba nʼalu makonka makole. Babikile Danyele, yeye neakuleshe dijingulula dia bualu ebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakalua ne Danyele ku mpala kua mukelenge. Mukelenge wakakonka Danyele ne, Wewe udi Danyele au, wa munkatshi mua bahika ba ku buloba bua Yuda, wakangata tatu wanyi mukelenge ku buloba bua Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunvua lumu luebe ne, Nyuma wa nzambi udi munda muebe, ne munya, ne dijingulula dia malu ne meji mahite bulengele bidi bimueneka munda muebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakulua ne bena meji, bamanyi ba malu a mitoto, ku mpala kuanyi, bua kumbadila tshifundu etshi ne kummanyishabo dijingulula diatshi; kadi kabakamanya mua kundesha dijingulula dia bualu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nakunvua lumu luebe ne, wewe udi mua kujingulula bantu malu a nunku ne kuitaba makonka makole. Nunku, biwamanya mua kubala tshifundu etshi ne kummanyisha dijingulula diatshi, nebakuluatshishe bivualu bikunzubile, nebakuele lukanu lua or mu nshingu muebe ne nebakuteke bu muisatu wa mu bukelenge buanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Danyele wakakudimuna dî ku mpala kua mukelenge ne, Uditekele bintu biebe, uheshe muntu mukuabo biudi musue kunfuta; kadi nembadile mukelenge tshifundu, nemmumanyishe dijingulula diatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, umanye ne, Nzambi Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu wakaha Nebukadenesâ tatuʼebe bukelenge, bunene, butumbi ne buneme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bunene buakamuhesheye, bantu ba bisamba bionso ne ba mu miaku yonso bakazakala ku mpala kuandi ne bakamutshina. Bakasueye kushiha, wakabashiha; bakasueye kushiya ne muoyo, wakabashiya ne muoyo; bakasueye kubandisha, wakababandisha; bakasueye kuhuekesha, wakabahuekesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hakadisueye, ne hakakolesheye mutshima wandi, ne bua malu â yeye wakenza malu a dihetu, bakamûmusha mu nkuasa wandi wa bukelenge, bakamunyenga butumbi buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamuihata munkatshi mua bukua bantu, mutshima wandi wakavuishibua bu wa nyama, wakashikama ne nyama ya mpunda ya mu mpata. Wakadia mashinde bu mudi ngombe idia, ne mubidi wandi wakabola ne dibungi dia mulu to ne hakamanyeye ne, Nzambi Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu udi ukokesha mu bukelenge bua bantu, ne udi uteka muntu yonso udiye musue ku mutu kuabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne wewe muanʼandi, Beleshasâ, kuena muanji kudihuekesha, nansha wewe mumanye malu au onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi wakudibandisha ne wakuhetula Mukelenge wa mu diulu; bua bakulua ne mpanza ya mu nsubu muandi ku mpala kuebe; wewe ne miloho yebe, bakashi bebe ne bakashi bahika bawakabaka nuakunuinamu nvinyo. Wewe wakutumbisha nzambi ya tshiamu tshia argent ne tshia or, ya tshiamu tshia mitaku, ya tshiamu tshifike, ya mitshi ne ya mabue, nzambi idi kayiyi mua kumona anyi kunyua anyi kumanya bualu. Kuena mutumbishe Nzambi udi ne muhuya webe mu tshianza tshiandi, udi mumanye bienzedi biebe bionso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua malu â wakatuma tshituha atshi tshia tshianza tshiakafunda tshifundu etshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etshi ntshifundu tshiakafundibua: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, OUPHARSIN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eku nkujingulula kua muanda eu: MENE, Nzambi wakubala matuku a bukelenge buebe, wakubumana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "TEKEL, bakukuidikisha mu tshiamu tshia kuidikisha nʼatshi bujitu, bakukusangana kuyi mukumbane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PERES, bakutahulula bukelenge buebe, bakubuha Bena Madai ne Bena Pelasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
